# (P2b motion proto6 i1 + i2, 2026-10-22) THE RUN'S PUMP, side views pF pB pN pM pK: her bare forearm and hand facing
# right (pB back behind the hip, pN at the hip, pF forward-up ahead of the chest) and her far right forearm facing
# left (pF / pB darker). (proto6 i2) pF and pB now swing the upper arm out of her sleeve too (region U, the garment's
# colour), the elbow forward (pF) or back (pB); pM forward-mid (the forearm forward-down, the hand ahead of the belt),
# pK back-mid (the hand behind the hip). Her garment sleeves carry views for these keys (wear/woman/*_sleeve_*,
# poncho_drape_*).
view R key pF origin 0 -1
mark handR 6 1
